    "generated_sql": "SELECT ar.Name, SUM(il.UnitPrice * il.Quantity) AS total_revenue FROM InvoiceLine il JOIN Track t ON il.TrackId = t.TrackId JOIN Album al ON t.AlbumId = al.AlbumId JOIN Artist ar ON al.ArtistId = ar.ArtistId GROUP BY ar.ArtistId ORDER BY total_revenue DESC LIMIT 5;",
    "sql_confidence": "high",
    "sql_explanation": "This query calculates the total revenue for each artist by joining the InvoiceLine, Track, Album, and Artist tables. It sums up the product of UnitPrice and Quantity for each track sold, groups the results by artist, and orders them by total revenue in descending order, limiting the results to the top 5 artists.",
